{"id":"3C","title":"Love","part":{"n":3,"title":"Relationship to Other Persons"},"url":"/law/03-relationship-to-other-persons/3c","entries":[{"id":"3C.1","text":"You shall love your neighbor as yourself.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"18"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":19,"verses":"19"},{"book":"Matthew","chapter":22,"verses":"39"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":12,"verses":"31"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":10,"verses":"27-28"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":13,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Galatians","chapter":5,"verses":"14"},{"book":"James","chapter":2,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Lev. 19:18; Matt. 19:19; Matt. 22:39; Mark 12:31; Luke 10:27-28; Rom. 13:9; Gal. 5:14; James 2:8."},{"id":"3C.2","text":"Christians commanded to love one another as Christ has loved you.","refs":[{"book":"John","chapter":13,"verses":"34-35"},{"book":"John","chapter":15,"verses":"12-14,17"},{"book":"Romans","chapter":12,"verses":"10"},{"book":"1 Thessalonians","chapter":4,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":13,"verses":"1"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":1,"verses":"22"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":2,"verses":"17"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":3,"verses":"8"},{"book":"1 John","chapter":2,"verses":"9"},{"book":"1 John","chapter":3,"verses":"11"},{"book":"1 John","chapter":4,"verses":"7,11"},{"book":"2 John","chapter":1,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"John 13:34- 35; John 15:12-14, 17; Rom. 12:10; 1 Thes. 4:9; Heb. 13:1; 1 Pet 1:22; 1 Pet 2:17; 1 Pet 3:8; 1 John 2:1 John 3:11; 1 John 4:7, 11; 2 John 1:5."},{"id":"3C.3","text":"Let us not love in word or in tongue, but in deed and in truth.","refs":[{"book":"John","chapter":3,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"John 3:18."},{"id":"3C.4","text":"We should walk in and pursue love.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":14,"verses":"1"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":5,"verses":"2"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 14:1; Eph. 5:2."},{"id":"3C.5","text":"He that does, not love his brother does not love God, for he that loves God loves his brother also.","refs":[{"book":"1 John","chapter":4,"verses":"20-21"}],"citation":"1 John 4:20-21; 5:1-3."},{"id":"3C.6","text":"Through love serve one another.","refs":[{"book":"Galatians","chapter":5,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"Gal. 5:13."},{"id":"3C.7","text":"He that loves not his brother abides in death and walks in darkness.","refs":[{"book":"1 John","chapter":2,"verses":"9-11"},{"book":"1 John","chapter":3,"verses":"14-15"}],"citation":"1 John 2:9- 11; 1 John 3:14-15."},{"id":"3C.8","text":"Let all that you do be done with love.","refs":[{"book":"1 Corinthians","chapter":16,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"1 Cor. 16:14."},{"id":"3C.9","text":"Love works no evil, and thus is the fulfilling of the law.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":13,"verses":"8-10"},{"book":"James","chapter":2,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Rom. 13:89 10; James 2:8."},{"id":"3C.10","text":"Let love be without hypocrisy.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":12,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Rom. 12:9."},{"id":"3C.11","text":"We are to fervently love one another with a pure heart.","refs":[{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":1,"verses":"22"}],"citation":"1 Pet. 1:22."},{"id":"3C.12","text":"Love should be promoted and maintained.","refs":[{"book":"Hebrews","chapter":13,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"Heb. 13:1."},{"id":"3C.13","text":"We should be tolerant and forbearing towards one another in order to show our love.","refs":[{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":4,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Ephesians","chapter":6,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"13"}],"citation":"Eph. 4:2; Eph. 6:9; Col. 3:13."},{"id":"3C.14","text":"The fruit of the Spirit is love, joy, peace, patience, gentleness, goodness, faith.","refs":[{"book":"Galatians","chapter":5,"verses":"22"}],"citation":"Gal. 5:22."},{"id":"3C.15","text":"Love covers a multitude of sins.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":10,"verses":"12"},{"book":"1 Peter","chapter":4,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Prov. 10:12; 1 Pet. 4:8."},{"id":"3C.16","text":"Open rebuke is better than love carefully concealed.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":27,"verses":"5"}],"citation":"Prov. 27:5."}]}